cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Animal Toxin Atlas, please cite UniProt and the Tox-Prot programme first, then this software."
title: "Animal Toxin Atlas: an interactive browser for UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot animal venom protein records"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "YYYY-MM-DD"            # fill in at release
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<your-github-user>/animal-toxin-atlas"
url: "https://<your-github-user>.github.io/animal-toxin-atlas/"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based atlas of 8,274 reviewed UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot animal venom protein records with
  disulfide connectivity patterns, AlphaFold confidence, ProtT5/ProstT5 embedding maps, structural-gap and potency
  views, and local sequence similarity search.
keywords:
  - venom
  - animal toxins
  - UniProt
  - Tox-Prot
  - AlphaFold
  - protein language models
authors:
